---
// SCRATCH PAGE — logo exploration v4: Aperture + Signal, detailed.
// Originals backed up in brand/backup/. Not linked from nav. DELETE before launch.
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Logo lab" description="Personal logo exploration — scratch page.">
  <h1>Logo lab <span class="mono-label">v4 — aperture &amp; signal, detailed</span></h1>
  <p class="mono-label">originals saved to brand/backup/ · two detailed evolutions each</p>

  <!-- Reference row -->
  <section class="variant">
    <h2>Originals <span class="tag">backed up</span></h2>
    <div class="stage">
      <svg class="mark-ref" viewBox="0 0 52 56" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="Aperture original">
        <g fill="none">
          <path d="M26 4 L45.9 15.5 L45.9 38.5 L26 50 L6.1 38.5 L6.1 15.5 Z" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.8"/>
          <g transform="rotate(10 26 27)"><path d="M26 10 L40.7 18.5 L40.7 35.5 L26 44 L11.3 35.5 L11.3 18.5 Z" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.3" opacity="0.65"/></g>
          <g transform="rotate(20 26 27)"><path d="M26 16 L35.5 21.5 L35.5 32.5 L26 38 L16.5 32.5 L16.5 21.5 Z" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.4"/></g>
          <g transform="rotate(30 26 27)"><path d="M26 21.2 L31 24.1 L31 29.9 L26 32.8 L21 29.9 L21 24.1 Z" style="stroke: var(--accent)" stroke-width="2.2"/></g>
        </g>
      </svg>
      <svg class="mark-ref" viewBox="0 0 52 56" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="Signal original">
        <g fill="none" stroke-linecap="round">
          <path d="M26 4 L45.9 15.5 L45.9 38.5 L26 50 L6.1 38.5 L6.1 21" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="2.2"/>
          <path d="M6.1 15.5 L26 4" style="stroke: var(--accent)" stroke-width="2.2"/>
          <path d="M26 27 L26 12 M26 27 L38 34 M26 27 L14.5 33.5" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.1" opacity="0.5"/>
        </g>
        <circle cx="26" cy="27" r="3.2" style="fill: var(--accent)"/>
        <circle cx="26" cy="12" r="1.7" style="fill: var(--fg)"/>
        <circle cx="38" cy="34" r="1.7" style="fill: var(--fg)"/>
        <circle cx="14.5" cy="33.5" r="1.7" style="fill: var(--fg)" opacity="0.6"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- A1: Iris -->
  <section class="variant">
    <h2>A1 — Aperture · Iris</h2>
    <p class="note">
      True iris mechanics: six blade lines connect each outer vertex to the next layer's
      rotated vertex, plus calibration ticks at the vertices. The layers now read as one
      rotating mechanism, not stacked outlines.
    </p>
    <div class="stage">
      <svg class="mark-lg" viewBox="0 0 52 56" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="Aperture Iris mark">
        <g fill="none">
          <path d="M26 4 L45.9 15.5 L45.9 38.5 L26 50 L6.1 38.5 L6.1 15.5 Z" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.8"/>
          <path d="M26 7 L26 4 M43.3 17 L45.9 15.5 M43.3 37 L45.9 38.5 M26 47 L26 50 M8.7 37 L6.1 38.5 M8.7 17 L6.1 15.5"
            style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.1" opacity="0.7"/>
          <path d="M26 4 L28.95 10.26 M45.92 15.5 L41.97 21.19 M45.92 38.5 L39.02 37.93 M26 50 L23.05 43.74 M6.08 38.5 L10.03 32.81 M6.08 15.5 L12.98 16.07"
            style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="0.9" opacity="0.45"/>
          <g transform="rotate(10 26 27)"><path d="M26 10 L40.7 18.5 L40.7 35.5 L26 44 L11.3 35.5 L11.3 18.5 Z" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.3" opacity="0.65"/></g>
          <g transform="rotate(20 26 27)"><path d="M26 16 L35.5 21.5 L35.5 32.5 L26 38 L16.5 32.5 L16.5 21.5 Z" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.4"/></g>
          <g transform="rotate(30 26 27)"><path d="M26 21.2 L31 24.1 L31 29.9 L26 32.8 L21 29.9 L21 24.1 Z" style="stroke: var(--accent)" stroke-width="2.2"/></g>
        </g>
        <circle cx="26" cy="27" r="1.4" style="fill: var(--fg)"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="lockup-stack">
        <svg class="mark-sm" viewBox="0 0 52 56" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <g fill="none">
            <path d="M26 4 L45.9 15.5 L45.9 38.5 L26 50 L6.1 38.5 L6.1 15.5 Z" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="2.4"/>
            <g transform="rotate(30 26 27)"><path d="M26 16 L35.5 21.5 L35.5 32.5 L26 38 L16.5 32.5 L16.5 21.5 Z" style="stroke: var(--accent)" stroke-width="3"/></g>
          </g>
          <circle cx="26" cy="27" r="1.8" style="fill: var(--fg)"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="wordmark-block">
          <span class="wm-name">ALEXANDRU HERA</span>
          <span class="wm-desc">SECURITY OPERATIONS</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- A2: Instrument -->
  <section class="variant">
    <h2>A2 — Aperture · Instrument</h2>
    <p class="note">
      Bezel treatment: a fine dashed ring inside the outer wall (dial calibration),
      and the core gets a translucent accent fill — the "eye" now glows rather than outlines.
    </p>
    <div class="stage">
      <svg class="mark-lg" viewBox="0 0 52 56" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="Aperture Instrument mark">
        <g fill="none">
          <path d="M26 4 L45.9 15.5 L45.9 38.5 L26 50 L6.1 38.5 L6.1 15.5 Z" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.8"/>
          <path d="M26 5.7 L44.4 16.35 L44.4 37.65 L26 48.3 L7.6 37.65 L7.6 16.35 Z"
            style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="0.8" stroke-dasharray="2 3" opacity="0.45"/>
          <g transform="rotate(10 26 27)"><path d="M26 10 L40.7 18.5 L40.7 35.5 L26 44 L11.3 35.5 L11.3 18.5 Z" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.3" opacity="0.6"/></g>
          <g transform="rotate(20 26 27)"><path d="M26 16 L35.5 21.5 L35.5 32.5 L26 38 L16.5 32.5 L16.5 21.5 Z" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.35"/></g>
          <g transform="rotate(30 26 27)">
            <path d="M26 21.2 L31 24.1 L31 29.9 L26 32.8 L21 29.9 L21 24.1 Z"
              style="stroke: var(--accent); fill: var(--accent); fill-opacity: 0.18" stroke-width="2.2"/>
          </g>
        </g>
      </svg>
      <div class="lockup-stack">
        <svg class="mark-sm" viewBox="0 0 52 56" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <g fill="none">
            <path d="M26 4 L45.9 15.5 L45.9 38.5 L26 50 L6.1 38.5 L6.1 15.5 Z" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="2.4"/>
            <g transform="rotate(30 26 27)">
              <path d="M26 16 L35.5 21.5 L35.5 32.5 L26 38 L16.5 32.5 L16.5 21.5 Z"
                style="stroke: var(--accent); fill: var(--accent); fill-opacity: 0.18" stroke-width="3"/>
            </g>
          </g>
        </svg>
        <div class="wordmark-block">
          <span class="wm-name">ALEXANDRU HERA</span>
          <span class="wm-desc">SECURITY OPERATIONS</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- S1: Network -->
  <section class="variant">
    <h2>S1 — Signal · Network</h2>
    <p class="note">
      The graph grows: secondary branches with smaller nodes, and two emission arcs
      radiating from the core toward the broken edge — the mark now "transmits".
    </p>
    <div class="stage">
      <svg class="mark-lg" viewBox="0 0 52 56" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="Signal Network mark">
        <g fill="none" stroke-linecap="round">
          <path d="M26 4 L45.9 15.5 L45.9 38.5 L26 50 L6.1 38.5 L6.1 21" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="2.2"/>
          <path d="M6.1 15.5 L26 4" style="stroke: var(--accent)" stroke-width="2.2"/>
          <path d="M26 27 L26 12 M26 27 L38 34 M26 27 L14.5 33.5" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.1" opacity="0.5"/>
          <path d="M38 34 L43.5 30.5 M26 12 L32 9.5" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="0.9" opacity="0.4"/>
          <circle cx="26" cy="27" r="6" style="stroke: var(--accent)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="10.5 27.2" transform="rotate(-125 26 27)" opacity="0.55"/>
          <circle cx="26" cy="27" r="9" style="stroke: var(--accent)" stroke-width="0.9" stroke-dasharray="14 42.5" transform="rotate(-118 26 27)" opacity="0.3"/>
        </g>
        <circle cx="26" cy="27" r="3.2" style="fill: var(--accent)"/>
        <circle cx="26" cy="12" r="1.7" style="fill: var(--fg)"/>
        <circle cx="38" cy="34" r="1.7" style="fill: var(--fg)"/>
        <circle cx="14.5" cy="33.5" r="1.7" style="fill: var(--fg)" opacity="0.6"/>
        <circle cx="43.5" cy="30.5" r="1.2" style="fill: var(--fg)" opacity="0.7"/>
        <circle cx="32" cy="9.5" r="1.2" style="fill: var(--fg)" opacity="0.7"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="lockup-stack">
        <svg class="mark-sm" viewBox="0 0 52 56" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <g fill="none" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M26 4 L45.9 15.5 L45.9 38.5 L26 50 L6.1 38.5 L6.1 21" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="2.8"/>
            <path d="M6.1 15.5 L26 4" style="stroke: var(--accent)" stroke-width="2.8"/>
          </g>
          <circle cx="26" cy="27" r="4" style="fill: var(--accent)"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="wordmark-block">
          <span class="wm-name">ALEXANDRU HERA</span>
          <span class="wm-desc">SECURITY OPERATIONS</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- S2: Telemetry -->
  <section class="variant">
    <h2>S2 — Signal · Telemetry</h2>
    <p class="note">
      Data-in-flight: one perimeter edge dissolves into dashes, two diamond "packets"
      travel the outbound trace, and the core wears an orbit ring. Busiest of the four —
      strongest at large sizes.
    </p>
    <div class="stage">
      <svg class="mark-lg" viewBox="0 0 52 56" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="Signal Telemetry mark">
        <g fill="none" stroke-linecap="round">
          <path d="M26 4 L45.9 15.5 L45.9 38.5" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="2.2"/>
          <path d="M45.9 38.5 L26 50" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="3 3.4" opacity="0.75"/>
          <path d="M26 50 L6.1 38.5 L6.1 21" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="2.2"/>
          <path d="M6.1 15.5 L26 4" style="stroke: var(--accent)" stroke-width="2.2"/>
          <path d="M26 27 L26 12 M26 27 L38 34 M26 27 L14.5 33.5" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.1" opacity="0.5"/>
          <circle cx="26" cy="27" r="5.4" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.4"/>
        </g>
        <circle cx="26" cy="27" r="3" style="fill: var(--accent)"/>
        <rect x="30" y="28.9" width="2" height="2" transform="rotate(45 31 29.9)" style="fill: var(--accent)"/>
        <rect x="34" y="31.2" width="2" height="2" transform="rotate(45 35 32.2)" style="fill: var(--accent)" opacity="0.6"/>
        <circle cx="26" cy="12" r="1.7" style="fill: var(--fg)"/>
        <circle cx="38" cy="34" r="1.7" style="fill: var(--fg)"/>
        <circle cx="14.5" cy="33.5" r="1.7" style="fill: var(--fg)" opacity="0.6"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="lockup-stack">
        <svg class="mark-sm" viewBox="0 0 52 56" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <g fill="none" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M26 4 L45.9 15.5 L45.9 38.5 L26 50 L6.1 38.5 L6.1 21" style="stroke: var(--fg)" stroke-width="2.8"/>
            <path d="M6.1 15.5 L26 4" style="stroke: var(--accent)" stroke-width="2.8"/>
          </g>
          <circle cx="26" cy="27" r="4" style="fill: var(--accent)"/>
          <rect x="33.2" y="30.4" width="2.4" height="2.4" transform="rotate(45 34.4 31.6)" style="fill: var(--accent)"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="wordmark-block">
          <span class="wm-name">ALEXANDRU HERA</span>
          <span class="wm-desc">SECURITY OPERATIONS</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .variant {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  .note {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    max-width: 34rem;
  }

  .stage {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .mark-lg { height: 6.5rem; }
  .mark-sm { height: 3rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .mark-ref { height: 3.5rem; opacity: 0.85; }

  .lockup-stack {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  .wordmark-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
  }

  .wm-name {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    color: var(--fg);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .wm-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.42em;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
</style>
